        "title": "CIA Reading Room cia-rdp79-01194a000100350001-7: 'SOVIET-U.S. NAVAL COMPETITION IN THE INDIAN OCEAN' BY ALVIN J. COTTRELL AND R.M. BURRELL, ORBIS XVIII, WINTER 1975.",
