      {
        "identifier": "https://openalex.org/W7126049062",
        "title": "Author Correction: Hunter-gatherer sea voyages extended to remotest Mediterranean islands",
        "creator": [
          "Eleanor M. L. Scerri",
          "James Blinkhorn",
          "Huw S. Groucutt",
          "Mathew Stewart",
          "Ian Candy",
          "Ethel Allué",
          "Aitor Burguet-Coca",
          "Andrés Currás"
        ],
        "archival_reference": null,
        "specialist_agent": "contradiction",
        "description": "Since the version of the article initially published, two corrections have been made, which do not have a meaningful impact on our results. The errors referred to one specific element of our study, the regional model of the timing of the Mesolithic to Neolithic transition which was discussed in the Supplementary Information and presented in Extended Data Fig. 1. While we consider it scientifically prudent to issue a correction, we emphasise that the results of this specific part of our analysis (in essence, a summary of radiocarbon dates from the central Mediterranean) are virtually the same as previously published. Our results mirrored, and still mirror, the general consensus on the timing of the Neolithic transition in the region.",
        "subject": null,
        "context_excerpt": null,
        "mediatype": null,
        "metadata_text": null,
