        "description": [
          "32 pages : 30 cm",
          "Discusses the history of pirates, looking at the cruel pirate captains who terrorized their own crews as well as their victims, pirate weapons and ships, and how and where high-tech pirates are still in action today",
          "Includes index",
          "Includes bibliographical references (page 32) and index",
          "\"A+.\"",
          "\"Fantastic facts about pirates through the ages\"--Cover",
          "What is a pirate? -- Barbary corsairs -- Privateers -- Caribbean buccaneers -- Beware, pirates! -- Pirate weapons -- Pirate ships -- Life on the high seas -- Blackbeard -- Women pirates -- Treasure trove -- Pirate punishment -- Pirates today -- Glossary -- Index and wed sites"
        ],
        "subject": [
          "Pirates",
          "Pirates -- Juvenile literature",
          "Naval history"
        ],
