ron, and later corrugated asbestos plates were used. 23. Heated buildings with the roof slanting l0 or more were usually covered with 8t ,to (slabs made of a mixture of cement and asbestos, measuring 12\" ; 1;e\") over wooden sheathing. COWMWIWMWMM D@=gTro Sanitized Copy Approved for Release 2011/06/30: CIA-RDP80-00809A000600040341-9",
