        "description": null,
        "subject": null,
        "context_excerpt": "the  Mediterranean.\nThe  coastline  of  North  Africa  is  remarkable  for  its  excellent harbours — something … routes  of the  Mediterranean  were  unmolested,  and  the  island  ports  and harbours  of  the  European … the  pattern  of  life  and trade  in  the  Mediterranean  until  the  early  19th century.”\nThe  legendary … knows every  port  and  current  of  their  Mediterranean, they  have  found  their  destined  historian … live  for  any  length  of  time  in  the  Mediterranean without  coming  across  references  to  Barbarossa",
