        "evidence_excerpt": "“You cannot say I have not treated you well, Czsar,’’ \nsaid Spartaco, with a rough laugh. “ Fifty talents in \na lump do not often come the way of a poor corsair, \nbut I think I and my fellows have treated you like a \nking.”",
