        "evidence_excerpt": "Far and wide the marks of their evil deeds were spread. \nOn any morning, when the first rays of the sun shone into \nthe lofty atrium of some lovely villa perched amid the \ngreen woods overlooking the blue of the Mediterranean, \nand the family of the rich Roman or Greek was just \nstirring, there would come a cry of terror, crisping the \nnerves, chilling the heart, and filling the eyes of gentle \nwomen and children with the gleams of horror: ‘‘ The \npirates! The pirates !”’",
