        "evidence_excerpt": "been meant for the mouths of Rome’s hungry multitudes \nwere being sold by the impudent pirates in the markets \nof Asia Minor and the Greek islands. Instantly there \nwas a cry for vengeance ; riots took place in Rome, and \nthe senators found themselves compelled to undertake \nthe destruction of the power that was striking at the very \nlife of the State.",
