        "evidence_excerpt": "Instantly there was a rush to the high rock where the \nlook-out was kept, whence a boat could be seen being \nrapidly rowed south and east. The keen eyes of the \ncorsairs, even in the fading light, knew it for a Spanish \nvessel, with some dozen rowers aboard, who were pulling \nas if for dear life.",
