        "evidence_excerpt": "and placed their wives and children in it, with a few goods, \nresolved to trust themselves to the mercy of the winds \nand the waves rather than to that of their oppressor. \nThe women and children were now cowering in the bottom \nof the vessel, many of them sick and wretched, while the \nmen told their pitiable tale to the pirates.",
