        "evidence_excerpt": "day, and two days out were set upon by a brigantine, \nfilled with riff-raff from the port of Cadros. Thereupon \nUruj fought so well that his Christian master was high \nin his praises, and when they had put the pirates to flight \nwith several broken heads among them he called Uruj \nto him and made him great offers to enter his service \nas a permanent hand. ks",
