        "evidence_excerpt": "With the fall of Tlemcen Uruj became master of a \nterritory as large as the modern French colony of Algeria, \nand his exploits made many of the rulers about the \nMediterranean quake in their shoes. Here was a man, \na mere pirate, who feared neither God nor devil, who \nscattered the veteran forces of the King of Spain with as \nmuch ease as he put to flight the rabble army of an",
