        "evidence_excerpt": "The Spaniards were content with this reply and thought \nthat indeed the pirates had fled at the rumour of their \napproach. But just as dawn was breaking over the river \nthere came other sounds of rowing, and the noise of men \nclimbing by the chains into the forepart of the vessel. \nThe Spaniards were caught napping, the pirates were all \naboard ere the full ship’s company had tumbled up from \ntheir bunks. Then began a fierce fight; the Spaniards \nfought manfully, and when they had been forced to retreat \nto the poop they levelled their guns at their assailants \nand slew several. Nevertheless, the fierceness of the",
