      {
        "finding_id": "section-42753c822e4923df776e",
        "file": "cu31924087978445_cu31924087978445_djvu.txt",
        "title": "Sea-wolves of the Mediterranean; the grand period of the Moslem corsairs",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/cu31924087978445",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Currey, E. Hamilton (Edward Hamilton)",
          "date": [
            "1910-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "the  corsairs  were  frequently  defeated ;  what  is  really \nstrange  is  that  they  should  have  achieved  so  great \na  success — success  vouched  for  by  the  concrete \ninstance  that  they  established  those  sinister  dynas- \nties on  the  coast  of  Northern  Africa  which  were \nthe  outcome  of  their  piratical  activities.",
