        "evidence_excerpt": "temporaries,  and  for  many  generations  of  Moslem \nseamen  yet  to  come,  as  \"  the  King  of  the  Sea.\" \nThe  capture  of  Panama  by  Sir  Henry  Morgan \nin  January  1671  was  possibly  as  remarkable  a \nfeat  of  arms  as  was  ever  accomplished,  but  it \ncannot  rank  in  its  importance  to  civilised  /  man- \nkind on  the  same  plane  as  those  memorable  battles \nin  the  Mediterranean  of  which  mention  has  been \nmade  as  having  been  fought  by  the  Moslem \ncorsairs.",
        "years_in_scope": [
