        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "All  this  harmonised  well  with  his  reputation  as  a \nchief  so  resolute,  so  pitiless,  that  it  was  the  boast \nof  his  followers  that  his  very  name  shouted  in \nbattle  put  to  flight  the  Christian  vessels.  His \nsmile  was  fine  and  malicious,  his  speech  facile, \nrevealing  beneath  the  rude  exterior  of  the  corsair \nthe  subtle  man  of  affairs,  who,  from  nothing,  had \nmade  himself  King  of  Algiers,  and  was  now,  by  the \ninvitation  of  Sohman  the  Magnificent,  Admiralis- \nsimo  of  the  Ottoman  navy.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
