        "evidence_excerpt": "\"  I  have  forty  galleys,\"  repUed  the  corsair ; \n\"  you  have  forty  more.  With  these  I  will  take  the \nsea  ;  but,  mark  you,\"  he  continued,  softening  some- \nwhat, \"  you  do  right  to  fear  the  displeasure  of  the \nSultan,  and  I  also  have  no  wish  to  encounter  it ; \nbut  vessels  raised  and  equipped  in  a  hurry  will  be \nof  small  use  to  me.  In  the  name  of  Allah  the \ncompassionate  and  his  holy  Prophet  give  me  my \neighty  galleys  and  let  me  go.\"",
