        "evidence_excerpt": "years  to  come  as  the  weapon  of  the  corsairs  who \nhad  estabhshed  themselves  on  the  coast  of  Africa. \nThe  \"  long  ship  \"  was  still  to  be  the  cause  of  many \nan  awful  sea  tragedy,  whether  the  actors  therein \nwere  the  pirates  who  hailed  from  the  Barbary  coast \nor  their  most  capable  imitators  the  notorious  rovers \nof  SaUee.",
