        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Torch-bearers  among  the  pirates  leaped  into \nhouses  and  set  them  ablaze,  the  flames  volleyed \nand  crackled,  the  dense  smoke  rolled  upwards  to \nthe  stainless  sky,  the  night  was  a  hell  of  blood  and \nfire.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
