        "evidence_excerpt": "himself.  In  reality,  the  corsairs,  as  we  have  seen, \nplayed  the  game  of  the  Padishah,  as  a  rule,  at  no \nexpense  to  that  potentate  ;  when  they  were  in \ntrouble  he  was  therefore  by  no  means  indisposed \nto  render  them  assistance.",
