        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "been  reft  by  him  \"  from  one  Dragut,  a  corsair \nodious  to  both  God  and  man \"  ;  that  without  in \nany  way  departing  from  the  treaty  which  he  had \nmade  with  Sohman  \"  he  intended  to  pursue  this \npirate  whithersoever  he  might  go.\"",
