        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Just  after  the  first  reinforcements  had  been \nthrown  into  St.  Elmo  there  arrived  on  the  scene \nAli,  the  Lieutenant  of  Dragut.  This  corsair  came \nfrom  Alexandria  with  six  galleys,  on  board  of \nwhich  were  nine  hundred  men,  reinforcements  for \nthe   Turkish   army.     A   few  days   after  this  the",
