        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "The  council  on  which  the  corsair  had  been \nengaged  when  he  received  his  mortal  wound  had \nfor  its  object  the  complete  isolation  of  St.  Elmo \nfrom  II  Borgo ;  his  dispositions  were  completed \nand  his  orders  given  to  the  engineer  just  before \nhe  was  struck.",
