        "evidence_excerpt": "paces  distant.  In  default  of  offspring  he  maintained \nat  his  charges  five  hundred  corsairs,  whom  he  called \nhis  children.  He  died  in  the  year  1580,  and  with \nhim  what  has  been  called  the  \"  Grand  Period  of \nthe  Moslem  Corsairs  \"  in  this  book  may  be  said  to \nhave  come  to  an  end.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
