        "evidence_excerpt": "“You cannot say I have not treated you well, \nCesar, said Spartaco, with a rough laugh. “Fifty \ntalents in a lump do not often come the way of a \npoor corsair, but I think I and my fellows have treated \nyou like a king.”",
