        "source_text_sha256": "97e06b715ec15879e9da76b05cd5250edc5df0b287c0736c121fbebff2f7fc41",
        "evidence_excerpt": "the fifty talents besides other booty which had been \nseized and stored by the pirates, his eyes gleamed \ngreedily. When his narrative was ended Cesar said:",
