      {
        "finding_id": "section-2521dd4c2a6dc88fff73",
        "file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
        "title": "Sea-Wolves of the Mediterranean: The Grand Period of the Moslem Corsairs",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Currey, E. Hamilton",
          "date": [
            "1910-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "02bcc5c0781b01bf6c6e78ee0d5b8bfb31a02ea35b47565b888e171e88ef6ad9",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Both materially and psychologically this man \nsomewhat bewildered the despot: and his alter ego, \nthe Grand Vizier, happening to be away on a \nmission to Aleppo, Soliman had no one with whom \nto confer in a strictly confidential manner; for, \nafter the manner of autocrats, he had but few \nfamiliars, in fact it may be said none at all save \nthe statesman mentioned. His reception of the \ncorsair lacked, however, nothing in cordiality. He \ninquired after the incidents of the voyage, in- \nterested himself graciously in all that he was told \nconcerning Africa and the conflicting claims of \nChristian and Moslem in that region, and was \ngenerally courteous to his distinguished visitor. \nHe placed at his disposal a palace and attendants \non a scale commensurate with the state of a \nreigning sovereign, and sent his most distinguished \ngenerals to confer with Kheyr-ed-Din. The \nlatter, for the first time in his life, was thoroughly \nout of his element. His had been the life of the \nseaman and the soldier to begin with, and of later \nyears that of a rude and unquestioned despot on \na savage coast, surrounded by myrmidons to whom \nhis voice had been as the voice of a god. Never \nhad it been his lot before to dwell within the",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.112019",
          "source_file": "india.history.resource.112019_112019_djvu.txt",
