        "evidence_excerpt": "some among them kept their heads, and it also so \nhappened that her bed-chamber was the opposite \nside of the castle to that by which the pirates \napproached. A horse was brought round under \nthe window of the room, and, in her night-dress \nwith nothing but a shawl wrapped around her, \nwas Julia Gonzaga lowered out of her window on \nto the back of her horse. As she galloped for dear \nlife down the avenue of her home she heard the \nshrieks of her miserable household murdered in \ncold blood by the furious pirates who had thus \nbeen balked of their prey.",
