        "title": "Linked document: https://www.um.edu.mt/library/oar/bitstream/123456789/22300/1/2004%20%28b%29.The%20Order%20of%20St%20John%20and%20corsairing%20in%20the%20Meditterranean%20in%20the%2016th%20and%20the%2017th%20Centuries.pdf",
        "url": "https://www.um.edu.mt/library/oar//handle/123456789/22300",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": [
            "Carmel Cassar"
          ],
