        "evidence_excerpt": "In 1942 Andreas Tietze published a German translation of an Ottoman pirate\nnovel of the late seventeenth century, entitled “The discourse on Warden Captain Mahmud, on [his] victories over the damned dwellers of Hell, the Maltese”\n*",
