      {
        "finding_id": "section-78c436b2513190332571",
        "file": "893cb321e932ba3a878252fb.txt",
        "title": "Images of the Mediterranean in an Ottoman Pirate Novel from the Late Seventeenth Century",
        "url": "https://makale.isam.org.tr/server/api/core/bitstreams/e9b22c6b-e4de-482a-be2e-33b284a17014/content",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": null,
          "date": null,
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "9348e8969051079250376bb40ba76a85a2807ca05ec788735fb51803f5573fd4",
        "evidence_excerpt": "(Makâle-i Zındancı Mahmud Kapudan berâ-yı feth ü zafer-keştî-i Maltîz-i la’în-i\ndûzah-mekîn), one of the few (till now) known specimens of Ottoman ‘popular\nliterature’ recorded in this early era.1 The Ottoman text was published some two\ndecades later by Fahir İz based on the only known manuscript (Köprülü Hafız\nAhmed Paşa 214, ff. 70a-107b).2 Strangely enough, this important text has not\nbeen studied thoroughly so far, with the notable exception of some observations\nby Suraiya Faroqhi and Cemal Kafadar.3 However, it presents immense interest\nfor both the historian and the philologist, not only as a highly telling description\nof sea-faring, swashbuckling, and piracy in the Eastern Mediterranean, but also\nas a splendid specimen of Ottoman prose story.4\nThe original manuscript seems to be related to the circle of the Köprülü household. According to İz’ description, it also contains a history of the conquest of\nCandia (Herakleion, Kandiye), entitled Makale-i tevârîh-i ma’reke-i Kandiye, sene\n1077 (ff. 1a-70a), a text known in several other versions (Tarih-i Fazıl Ahmed Paşa\nve feth-i Kandiye, Hikâyet-i azimet-i sefer-i Kandiye, Tarih-i muteber).5 The manu1",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "EXPLICIT_PARAGRAPH",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://makale.isam.org.tr/server/api/core/items/59456243-09e9-407c-aefe-bd3421b9de4f",
