        "evidence_excerpt": "The other great area for pirates was the \nSpanish Main, which featured the famous \nbuccaneers, Harry Morgan who became \nGovernor of Jamaica, Ed’ard Teach, Blackbeard, \nwho ended up with his skull spitted on his \nbowsprit, and Captain William Kidd who was \ntried for murder at the Old Bailey and hanged at \nExecution Dock.",
