        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "This referred to one of the most daring recent exploits \nof Spartaco, in violating a temple to Venus in the island \nof Samos, which lay some thirty miles to the north \nof where they were seated. The beautiful building had \nbeen ruined by fire, after the pirates had put the priests \nand priestesses to the sword and had rifled the treasury \nand temple of all the wealth given to it by generations of \ndevout worshippers. The speaker had suggested this \nexploit to his chief, who sat beside him, and he rather \nprided himself upon his initiative.",
