        "evidence_excerpt": "When all were aboard Cesar ordered the pirate galleys \nto be stove in and sunk in deep water; after which, \nsetting sail before a favourable wind, he speedily made \nhis way to Pergamum, where dwelled the pretor, or \ngovernor-general, of the province of Asia Minor.",
