        "evidence_excerpt": "that had occurred. Junius, an austere, crafty-looking \nperson, said little while the tale was being told, but on \nlearning that Czsar had recovered the fifty talents besides \nother booty which had been seized and stored by the \n. pirates, his eyes gleamed greedily. When his narrative \nwas ended Cesar said :",
