        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Discipline and hard living won the day at last. The \nrascally pirates, beaten to the poop, saw before them only \nthe fierce faces and short, sharp swords of the legionaries, \nand behind them the sea. They cried for quarter, threw \ndown their weapons, and were quickly thrust into irons \nor bound with cords; and thus, made captives on their \nown boat,on which so often they had been victors and \nhad done so many cruel deeds to defenceless prisoners, \nthey would soon be driving over the sea toward their \nprison.",
