        },
        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "With these mysterious words Cadno went off. Elphin \nstood thunderstruck. Did they really suspect Wulf of \nhaving warned the pirates P But he would answer for \nWulf’s loyalty as his own. Was not Wulf his blood- \nbrother ? Had they not taken the old oath of eternal \nloyalty to each other by drinking one another’s blood ? \nCertainly Wulf was a Saxon, by race he was one of these \npirates, but—but—",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
