        "evidence_excerpt": "relating these matters, and entrusted it to Elphin, bidding \nhim make all haste to the sea fortresses to warn their \nnaval prefects on the way, and to carry his dispatch to \nNectarides at Rutupiz, as it was evident that the Picts \nand Scots were acting in conspiracy with the Saxon \npirates, and that a big attack might be expected quickly \nfrom the sea. ina",
