          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "“‘ Prefect,” said Varro, ‘‘ this man tells me that the \npirates have a secret place in an island off the coast of \nFrisia, where they take their prisoners and their booty, \nbefore shipping them to the mainland. He says they will \nnot be in great force there, and that three galleys’ crews \ncould destroy them. Take six galleys and this man to \nguide you. If he proves false, kill him; if he proves \ntrue, he shall get his former rank as optio in the For- \ntensians.”’",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
