        "evidence_excerpt": "the dull heavens, uttered something in a loud tone, as \nif it were a prayer. Then he turned to the misty sea, \nthe waves of which lapped at his feet, and spoke to it, \ngesturing with his hand to the captives as: he did so. \nWhen he had done, the other pirates raised a great \nshout as if in assent to what had been said, and each \nmade a curious gesture with his two hands.",
