        "evidence_excerpt": "Once they sailed up the Guadalquivir and attacked a \nrich, fair city there called Seville. The townspeople fled, \nand the pirates overran the place, ransacking the rich \nhouses of nobles and merchants and gaining great booty. \nThe king of that kingdom, by name Abencerrada, learn- \ning of this insolent attack in the heart of his kingdom,",
        "years_in_scope": [],
