        "evidence_excerpt": "Swiftly the men launched their boat, and Sidi turned \nthe nose of the brigantine to cut off the other vessel. \nThe pirates bent to their oars with a will, for each was \nglad of something to do, so long as it was in the way of \na chase. The other boat soon became aware that it \nwas being followed and its crew redoubled their efforts, \nbut in vain: the pirate boat swiftly overhauled the \nstranger and raced alongside.",
