        "evidence_excerpt": "Very leisurely the pirates drew up the anchors, and \nas a wind was now setting toward the south-west they \nunreefed the sails, and with a hearty cheer from the throats \nof the hundreds of Moslem galley slaves to whom the \nturn of events had given freedom, the three Spanish \ngalleys, preceded by the pirate ship, slipped gracefully \nover the waters and before long disappeared from sight.",
