      {
        "finding_id": "section-c5c87749f0cc2c099ff3",
        "file": "bookofpirates0000gilb_bookofpirates0000gilb_djvu.txt",
        "title": "The book of pirates",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/bookofpirates0000gilb",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Gilbert, Henry, 1868-1937",
          "date": [
            "1916-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "On many a night when haughty Spanish lords and their \nwives and daughters had sought their couches, thinking \nof anything rather than the Barbary pirates, they and \ntheir dependents would be roused in terror, amid the cries \nof fierce men and the flames of their burning homes, \nto find that the dreaded corsairs were upon them. No \nmercy was shown to any Christian who offered resistance, \nand soon the proud Spaniards, clad only in their night \ngarments, were being driven, together with peasants \nand villagers, down toward the sea coast. Then there \nwould be the misery of the passage, the stench of the \nhold adding to the wretchedness of sea sickness. After- \nward the unutterable shame of the slave market, where \nhaughty Spanish maidens and youths would be forced \nto stand and show their ‘ points’ like cattle, the raucous, \nbrutal tones of the auctioneer above their heads and \nthe eyes of Arab dealers burning into their flesh. Then, \nfor the men, there would be the years of unremitting \nlabour, either at the galley oar, beneath the whip of a \nslave-master, or on the land, suffering the tyranny of \nsome farmer who treated his slaves like cattle. As for \nthe women, the more beautiful would be sunk in the \nmysterious depths of a harem, never more to look upon \ntheir native land. Or there would be the weary waiting",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/bookofpirates0000gilb",
          "source_file": "bookofpirates0000gilb_bookofpirates0000gilb_djvu.txt",
