        "evidence_excerpt": "Now word was brought to the Berber monarch that \nSidi ben Muza craved audience of him. His ships the \nsovereign had already seen from his high palace windows, \nlooking like toyboats on the blue plains of the Mediter- \nranean under the brilliant sun. Permission was given \nto the pirate to enter, and soon, clothed in brilliant \napparel, and followed by his chief captains flashing in",
