        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Scared faces looked over the bulwarks into the galley \npacked thick with Moslem fighters and Christian slaves, \nand a flight of arrows stuck in pirates and rowers in- \ndifferently. Uruj lacked restraint and caution, and \ngenerally relied on the rush and force of a sudden attack. \nThe pirates had already dropped their sail, and had \nthrown out grappling irons, with which they hooked \nthemselves to the Christians’ bulwarks.",
