        "evidence_excerpt": "As the giant sailing vessel came lumbering toward \nthem the keen eyes of the pirates, straining to note every \nfeature of their foe, saw that the arms of Naples were \npainted on the bellying mainsail, and soon they saw her \nname upon the prow—La Galera di Napolt.",
