        "evidence_excerpt": "The corsairs now decided to attack with all their forces \nat once. Uruj and Khizr would grapple with the nef \nto port and starboard, and when they had closely engaged \nthe enemy and drawn his attention upon them Kara \nHassan would range his galley at the stern and board the \nnef there. |",
