        "evidence_excerpt": "When Selim the Grand Turk heard of the deed he re- \nmembered that Khizr had shown very great gifts of \nseamanship during the year that he had commanded \na war-galley for him, and this capture of the great \nNeapolitan nef showed that the pirate was a man to be \nhonoured and encouraged. The Sultan thereupon sent \nan officer of his Court to the camp of the Barbarossas",
