        "evidence_excerpt": "would find them in the little harbour of Bougie, safe \nfrom the villainous hands of any pirates—the “ Devil \nof the Sea,”’ for instance, or those new miscreants, the \nBarbarossas. Thus men and captains were congratula- \nting themselves, when suddenly a cry came from the \nlook-out man on the foretop of the leading vessel: \n“Galleys on the port bow!” ,",
