        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "held out. An expedition sent by the King of Spain to \neject the pirate from his recently won kingdom failed \ndismally. Don Diego de Vera, with some fifteen thousand \nmen, set out to punish this saucy rascal, but hardly had \n| de Vera thrown up entrenchments before the town when \nUruj issued forth at the head of his army, and such terror \nwas in his name, and so little confidence had the Spaniards \nin themselves, that the pirates sent the Christian army \nhurrying back to their ships, after killing three thousand \nof them.",
