        "evidence_excerpt": "African princelet. He had gained a kingdom as large \nas any one of the important States of Italy ; his ships \nwere everywhere, and their depredations caused enormous \nloss and injury to merchants in every port in Spain, \nFrance, and the merchant States of Genoa, Naples, and \nVenice. It was felt that this pirate king was becoming \na menace to Christendom itself.",
