        "evidence_excerpt": "Unflinchingly, therefore, the Spaniards swept over the \nglittering line of riches and kept up the hot pursuit of \nUruj and his pirates. The latter had already reached \nthe river, which ran between steep banks, difficult to \ndescend. The men began to file across the treacherous \nford. Half were already across when the cry arose from \nthe rear: “‘ The Spaniards are onus! The Spaniards !”",
