        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "At length Uruj engaged in combat with a Spanish \nlieutenant, who was armed with a long pike. The pirate \ntried to close upon his enemy, but the man, by name \nGarzia de Tineo, was deft with his weapon, and, shorten- \ning it, he thrust it into the corsair’s neck. Uruj stumbled, \nand instantly another soldier struck him on the head \nwith a sword, causing him to fall headlong. Leaping \nupon him, de Tineo with one stroke sheared the pirate’s \nhead from his body.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
