        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "they desire to be informed of. Insomuch that before \nthese corsairs have been absent from their abodes much \nlonger than perhaps twenty or thirty days, they return \nhome rich, with their vessels crowded with captives \nand ready to sink with the weight of wealth; with \nscarce any trouble thus reaping the fruits of all that the \navaricious Mexican and greedy Peruvian have been digging \nfrom the bowels of the earth, and the thrifty merchant \nhas been so many thousand leagues to procure.”",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
