        "evidence_excerpt": "The corsairs had various methods of attack. When \nthey sighted what looked like a fairly good cargo-vessel, \nthey ran up a foreign flag so as to quieten any suspicions \nwhich the quarry might have. Then they would \ngradually work their way toward their victim until \nthe merchantman would be able to look upon the deck \nof the corsair and to know from its packed crowd of",
