        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "When the Spanish captain arrived near the town \nthreatened by the pirates all seemed quiet, and the \nSpaniards lay at anchor in the river Estera, near the \ntown. Lolonais was aware of their coming, and conceived \na stratagem to take the vessel. Toward two o’clock one \nmorning the watch on the deck of the Spaniard heard \nthe sound of oars in the water on one side, and thinking \nfishermen were about the officer called out to them:",
