        "evidence_excerpt": "Lolonais thereupon went forward to Maracaibo, which \nis a prosperous city built on the western side of a great \nlake. The town is defended by a fort in which are \nmounted sixteen great guns. The pirates having landed \na league off the fort, advanced by degrees toward it; \nbut the governor had espied their landing, and had placed \nan ambush to cut them off behind, while he should attack \nthem in front. Lolonais was too wary, however, and he \ndefeated the ambush, which fled into the city. Then, \nafter a fierce battle of three hours, he became master of",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
