        "evidence_excerpt": "Startled by this creature’s horrible appearance and his \nshriek, the sailors give way, and next moment with a \nrush the pirates have swept the men to the hatchways, \ndown which they tumble ina heap. As they are driven \nback a hideous voice begins to cry all manner of fearful \nthreats and imprecations, mingled with oaths in Spanish \nand English.",
