        "evidence_excerpt": "In this way Captain Teach, commonly known as \nBlackbeard, got possession of the big ship the Great \nAllen, in which he made most of his later voyages, after \nchanging her name to the Queen Anne’s Revenge and \nmounting forty guns upon her. The morning after her \ncapture, the vanquished crew were ordered to tumble up \nfrom below and to make the vessel ship-shape, which they \ndid by tossing the dead pirates and their own dead ship- \nmates overboard, and slushing down the bloodstained",
