        "evidence_excerpt": "One day Teach fell in with a little sloop of ten guns \ncalled the Revenge, and on challenging her found that she \nwas the ship of a foolish planter turned pirate, named \nMajor Bonnet, who owned property in the island of \nBarbados. The Major had got tired of a humdrum \nexistence on land, and though himself quite ignorant of \nseamanship, he had got one or two reckless spirits to",
