        "evidence_excerpt": "about to be hanged a ship arrived from London with a \nproclamation prolonging the time during which his \nMajesty’s pardon was to be extended to pirates who \nsurrendered to his mercy. Hands claimed the benefit of \nthis dispensation and was let off. Later he was seen in \nLondon begging his bread along the streets.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
