          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "1901bb10294e81f32d98c63cba8e03792d5ae5388c5c8aacfc5b904d67fab94d",
        "evidence_excerpt": "“Go back to your place,” replied Kidd. ‘I am no \npirate and I will not become one for any of you.”",
