        "evidence_excerpt": "all  maritime  conflicts  of  the  time,  the  corsairs,  who \nhad  the  habit  of  the  sea,  were  more  than  a  match \nfor  soldiers  embarked  to  fight  on  an  unfamiliar \nelement.",
