        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "\"  But  such  does  not  happen  among  these  pirates. \n\"  On  the  contrary,  it  may  truthfully  be  said  that, \nwhile  in  towns  in  which  good  persons  dwell  good \nactions  receive  the  palms  and  the  crown,  it  is \namong  the  Corsairs  but  to  the  wicked  to  whom \nare  given  recompense  and  praise.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
