        },
        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "There  is  nothing  more  curious  in  the  history  of \nthe  corsairs  than  the  perpetual  ups  and  downs  of \ntheir  lives.  Thus  in  the  present  instance  the  ill- \nadvised  attack  of  Uruj  on   Bougie  had  reduced",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
