        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "and  from  this  we  may  date  the  permanent  estabhsh- \nment  of  those  piratical  States  in  that  part  of  the \nworld.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
