        "evidence_excerpt": "valour  of  the  corsair.  To  dally  in  the  Golden  Horn \nwhile  so  rich  a  prey  was  at  sea  to  be  picked  up \nby  his  Christian  foes  was  altogether  opposed  to \nhis  instincts :  never  to  throw  away  a  chance  in \nthe  game  of  life  had  ever  been  his  guiding \nprinciple.",
