        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Barbarossa  ravaged  Skios,  Andros,  and  other \nislands,  putting  them  under  contribution,  and  in \nthis  manner  raised  some  eight  thousand  ducats ; \nfrom  a  pen  of  guinea-fowl  to  a  king's  ransom, \nnothing  escaped  the  maw  of  this  most  rapacious \nof  corsairs.  Candia  and  some  other  islands  yielded \nup  some  small  spoil,  but  the  sufferings  of  such \ninsignificant  folk  as  the  wretched  islanders  were \nsoon  lost  to  the  sight  of  the  Christian  world  in  the",
        "years_in_scope": [],
