        "evidence_excerpt": "backing  as  the  admiral  had  came  from  among \nhis  own  men,  the  corsairs  whose  hves  had  been \nspent  at  sea,  but  their  opinions  were  but  dust  in \nthe  balance  once  the  all-powerful  Monuc  ranged \nhimself  on  the  side  of  the  malcontents.",
