        },
        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "canaille  the  pirate  hosts  by  whom  he  was  assailed, \nhad  its  counterpart  in  the  sturdy  valour  of  Chief \nBombardier  Francisco  d'Arba  and  the  other  name- \nless heroes  of  which  that  good  company  was  com- \nposed ;  to  them  we  render  that  homage  which  so \njustly  is  their  due.",
