        "evidence_excerpt": "Dragut  now  proposed  to  erect  batteries  on  the \nsame  side  of  the  Great  Port  as  that  on  which \nII  Borgo  was  situated  ;  on  the  point  now  known \nas  Ricasoli,  but  which  was  then  and  for  centuries \nafterwards  known  as  the  Punta  Delle  Forche  (or \nPoint  of  the  Gallows,  because  it  was  here  that  all \npirates  was  executed  ;  and  their  bodies,  swinging  in \nchains,  were  the  first  objects  that  met  the  eye  on \nentering  the  Great  Port).      In  this  he  was  over-",
