        "source_text_sha256": "e53211270a60a26aa03dc5168c85f7a9043def78664e708f0be035cea4a28c60",
        "evidence_excerpt": "stupidly  violent  these  pirates  were  by  nature,  and \nhow  they  were  welded  into  a  homogeneous  whole \nby  those  of  whom  we  speak,  we  are  forced  to  the \nconclusion  that  seldom,  in  all  the  ages,  have  abler \ncaptains  arisen  to  take  fortune  at  the  flood,  to \ndominate  the  minds  and  the  bodies  of  a  vast  host, \nto  prove  that  they  were,  in  deed  and  in  truth, \nsupreme  as  leaders  of  men.",
